    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001010010,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "え、合格！？\r\nそっか……よかったー",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400101/7014001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんだか、嬉しいっていうよりも安心したって顔だな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001010020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、そう見えちゃった？\r\nでも、プロデューサーさんの言う通りかな",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400101/7014001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は納得できる結果だと思うけどな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001010030,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そーなの、かな？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400101/7014001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ、\r\n甘奈は、良くやってると思うぞ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "歌もダンスも良くできているし、\r\nファンサービスだって申し分ない",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001010040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "え～買いかぶりすぎだよ～",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400101/7014001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことないさ\r\n甘奈を見ていたお客さん、みんな笑顔だった",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ステージの袖で見ていて、俺はうれしかったよ\r\n甘奈ならこの調子でどんどん進めるはずだって思えたんだ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001010050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、ありがと！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400101/7014001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001010060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "でも、プロデューサーさんにそう言われると\r\n本当にいけそうな気がしてきちゃうね",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400101/7014001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやいや、俺は確信して言ってるぞ！",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001010070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "じゃあ、甘奈も期待しちゃおっかな",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400101/7014001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001010080,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈、次のステージもがんばるね",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400101/7014001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7014001010090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "早速、レッスンしに行こっ\r\nプロデューサーさん、付き合ってくれる？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701400101/7014001010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ、もちろんだ！",
    "charLabel": "amana",
